        <abstract>
            <para>Environmental DNA (eDNA) collected by NOAA Ship Okeanos Explorer during expedition EX2201: 2022 ROV and Mapping Shakedown (February 23 - March 3, 2022), Pascagoula, Mississippi to Key West, Florida. eDNA samples (6) collected by ROV and metabarcoded using 12S, 18S (V4), and COI markers.</para>
        </abstract>
